    "created_at": "2019-09-02T20:19:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-09-02T20:19:26Z",
    "body": "Note that the same section of the loading algorithm also sets `seeking` to false without firing a `”seeked”` event, not will it fire a `”durationchange”` event. Given that there’s a note explaining the latter event, I assume that this choice was made purposefully. Why?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
